Subject: [PATCH 11/11] Replace date-fns with dependency-free
 Intl.DateTimeFormat helper

date-fns is declared in package.json (react-day-picker needs it as a peer
dep, so it stays there) but wasn't resolving in the build environment even
after a clean node_modules reinstall. Rather than keep debugging the
package-manager/registry issue, added lib/format-date.ts using
Intl.DateTimeFormat and swapped every direct date-fns import in app code:
JournalEntryDetail, InvoiceDetail, InvoicesList, ClientDetail. Output is
identical to the old 'MMM dd, yyyy' format string.

Verified: npx tsc --noEmit passes clean.
